1
00:00:00,005 --> 00:00:01,555
(This drama complied with production
guidelines for filming child actors,)

2
00:00:01,557 --> 00:00:03,000
(and some scenes used
generative AI technology.)

3
00:00:03,237 --> 00:00:05,237
(Episode 61)

4
00:00:29,985 --> 00:00:31,008
Ma'am.

5
00:00:33,408 --> 00:00:35,309
Ma'am, what am I going to do?

6
00:00:36,239 --> 00:00:37,608
Because of me...

7
00:00:39,270 --> 00:00:40,882
I'm so scared.

8
00:00:42,138 --> 00:00:44,018
What if he doesn't wake up?

9
00:00:45,392 --> 00:00:47,876
What if Ji Hu leaves us like this...

10
00:00:49,757 --> 00:00:51,434
I really...

11
00:00:52,940 --> 00:00:54,360
No.

12
00:00:54,759 --> 00:00:56,327
That will never happen.

13
00:00:56,358 --> 00:00:57,846
Don't think like that.

14
00:00:58,168 --> 00:01:00,269
Why on earth...

15
00:01:00,809 --> 00:01:02,014
Why me?

16
00:01:02,174 --> 00:01:04,184
Why would he go this far for me?

17
00:01:05,310 --> 00:01:06,632
Ji Hu...

18
00:01:08,172 --> 00:01:09,833
really liked you.

19
00:01:10,312 --> 00:01:11,897
He told me once.

20
00:01:12,758 --> 00:01:16,428
But he couldn't bring himself to tell you
because he was afraid you'd reject him.

21
00:01:18,926 --> 00:01:20,475
He confessed his feelings to me.

22
00:01:20,937 --> 00:01:22,970
I hit him. I was so angry.

23
00:01:24,672 --> 00:01:26,964
But Do Hee overheard us.

24
00:01:27,492 --> 00:01:29,861
- So...
- What on earth is wrong with her?

25
00:01:31,472 --> 00:01:33,664
That's not the point, ma'am.

26
00:01:35,343 --> 00:01:38,070
I hate how love can explode like this.

27
00:01:38,958 --> 00:01:41,745
This kind of passion
that defies even death...

28
00:01:43,212 --> 00:01:44,913
I can't handle it.

29
00:01:45,356 --> 00:01:47,723
How am I supposed to accept
such overwhelming love?

30
00:01:48,457 --> 00:01:49,472
Ji Ni.

31
00:01:49,497 --> 00:01:51,410
Did I ask him to save me?

32
00:01:51,674 --> 00:01:53,295
Did I ask him to love me?

33
00:01:53,838 --> 00:01:58,946
Why would he risk himself like that?

34
00:01:59,092 --> 00:02:01,663
What am I supposed to do with that?

35
00:02:02,798 --> 00:02:04,297
Don't blame yourself.

36
00:02:04,489 --> 00:02:07,812
His love for you just came naturally.

37
00:02:07,836 --> 00:02:09,146
Like water.

38
00:02:09,745 --> 00:02:11,939
It wasn't a fire meant to burn you.

39
00:02:13,392 --> 00:02:14,392
Even if...

40
00:02:15,247 --> 00:02:17,207
the worst should happen,

41
00:02:17,615 --> 00:02:19,201
it wouldn't be your fault.

42
00:02:20,216 --> 00:02:21,596
Could that really happen?

43
00:02:21,732 --> 00:02:23,303
What have you heard?

44
00:02:23,647 --> 00:02:24,780
Nothing.

45
00:02:25,131 --> 00:02:26,921
We're all just waiting right now.

46
00:02:28,058 --> 00:02:29,846
I'm saying this for your sake.

47
00:02:30,332 --> 00:02:33,367
Ji Hu didn't love you just to hurt you.

48
00:02:33,657 --> 00:02:35,646
Don't torment yourself.

49
00:02:37,176 --> 00:02:38,443
Ma'am...

50
00:02:40,441 --> 00:02:41,465
I...

51
00:02:42,603 --> 00:02:44,239
I feel it too.

52
00:02:44,976 --> 00:02:46,710
I'm human too.

53
00:02:47,645 --> 00:02:49,937
I'm a woman too.

54
00:02:50,705 --> 00:02:55,142
How could I not have felt that warmth?

55
00:03:12,656 --> 00:03:14,656
(ICU 2)

56
00:03:25,958 --> 00:03:27,488
You're here?

57
00:03:31,992 --> 00:03:33,323
What are you doing here?

58
00:03:34,499 --> 00:03:37,166
I told you to stay away. You're bad luck.

59
00:03:37,191 --> 00:03:38,447
Why are you here?

60
00:03:38,472 --> 00:03:41,303
You nearly killed my son,
and you have the nerve to show up here?

61
00:03:41,457 --> 00:03:42,659
Sun Kyung.

62
00:03:43,809 --> 00:03:45,639
Why do you keep hanging around her?

63
00:03:45,796 --> 00:03:47,726
You even brought her to your wedding.

64
00:03:48,085 --> 00:03:50,714
Her mom was a married man's mistress.

65
00:03:50,878 --> 00:03:53,116
- Did you know that?
- I'm sorry.

66
00:03:53,760 --> 00:03:55,414
I'm so sorry.

67
00:04:30,876 --> 00:04:32,876
(13th Busan International
Youth Piano Competition)

68
00:04:42,578 --> 00:04:44,952
- Let's go to the internet cafe.
- Why would we go there?

69
00:04:45,496 --> 00:04:46,669
Excuse me!

70
00:04:56,225 --> 00:04:57,345
(DNA Paternity Test)

71
00:04:58,355 --> 00:05:00,286
(Probability of Paternity, 99.999 percent)

72
00:05:36,751 --> 00:05:38,650
You asked to meet me first.
So what's this?

73
00:05:38,675 --> 00:05:42,033
I'm sorry I kept you waiting.
Something came up.

74
00:05:42,058 --> 00:05:44,787
- I'll contact you another time.
- Don't contact me again.

75
00:05:45,352 --> 00:05:47,128
You abandoned me. Why show up now?

76
00:05:47,352 --> 00:05:49,202
I didn't abandon you.

77
00:05:49,621 --> 00:05:50,729
Well...

78
00:05:52,032 --> 00:05:53,836
I did abandon you, but...

79
00:05:54,941 --> 00:05:56,238
I had my reasons.

80
00:05:56,285 --> 00:05:57,672
I'll explain everything later.

81
00:05:57,696 --> 00:05:58,696
Forget it.

82
00:05:59,933 --> 00:06:01,123
Ji Hu?

83
00:06:02,462 --> 00:06:03,611
Who was it?

84
00:06:03,868 --> 00:06:04,998
It's nothing.

85
00:06:05,267 --> 00:06:06,546
Are you dating someone?

86
00:06:07,612 --> 00:06:10,772
Prepare for the next competition,
win first place, and get into Juilliard.

87
00:06:10,849 --> 00:06:13,079
Your dad's so proud of you.

88
00:06:14,089 --> 00:06:15,900
Piano's all you have.

89
00:06:16,356 --> 00:06:17,763
Get ready. Let's go.

90
00:06:27,825 --> 00:06:28,825
(June 2025, England, UK)
Mother.

91
00:06:28,827 --> 00:06:31,597
Please come to the embassy party
my dad is hosting at the end of the year.

92
00:06:31,622 --> 00:06:34,985
Ji Hu hasn't had much joy
since he quit piano.

93
00:08:14,405 --> 00:08:15,592
Ma'am.

94
00:08:16,396 --> 00:08:17,696
Thank you.

95
00:08:24,945 --> 00:08:26,453
Ji Ni!

96
00:08:26,970 --> 00:08:28,347
Ji Ni.

97
00:08:30,645 --> 00:08:32,268
I met her at the hospital.

98
00:08:38,325 --> 00:08:40,415
This is the retainer agreement
with the legal team.

99
00:08:42,319 --> 00:08:44,319
(Legal Services Agreement)

100
00:08:49,525 --> 00:08:51,829
That's Ambassador Do.

101
00:08:52,332 --> 00:08:55,330
Since you wouldn't answer,
I think he called me instead.

102
00:08:56,384 --> 00:08:57,478
Give it to me.

103
00:09:03,684 --> 00:09:05,202
Yes, Ambassador. It's me.

104
00:09:06,347 --> 00:09:08,544
I didn't answer
because I had nothing to say.

105
00:09:10,167 --> 00:09:11,317
Resolve this?

106
00:09:11,612 --> 00:09:13,890
Fine by me. I want to resolve this too.

107
00:09:14,295 --> 00:09:16,713
Then get Do Hee out of the hospital room.

108
00:09:17,151 --> 00:09:19,391
Avoiding an investigation
won't make this go away.

109
00:09:19,502 --> 00:09:21,130
My daughter was hurt too.

110
00:09:21,345 --> 00:09:23,792
She can't even walk.
How can she be questioned?

111
00:09:23,817 --> 00:09:25,932
We all know she's faking being sick.

112
00:09:26,311 --> 00:09:28,159
Ji Hu is still unconscious.

113
00:09:28,184 --> 00:09:29,870
Your daughter hit my son.

114
00:09:29,894 --> 00:09:31,894
We don't even know if he'll ever wake up.

115
00:09:31,919 --> 00:09:34,217
I know he was moved to a regular room
a few days ago.

116
00:09:34,416 --> 00:09:35,539
He'll wake up soon.

117
00:09:35,586 --> 00:09:37,717
- You're being so dramatic.
- Dramatic?

118
00:09:37,864 --> 00:09:39,221
Watch what you say.

119
00:09:39,246 --> 00:09:41,351
Would you say that
if your daughter were in a coma?

120
00:09:41,447 --> 00:09:43,935
Should I run your daughter over too,
so you know what it feels like?

121
00:09:43,953 --> 00:09:46,017
If you've seen the dashcam footage,
you'd know that...

122
00:09:46,178 --> 00:09:48,321
Ji Hu ran in front of a moving car.

123
00:09:48,825 --> 00:09:50,772
At least get the facts straight
before you speak.

124
00:09:50,790 --> 00:09:53,772
The problem is that she saw him
and didn't hit the brakes.

125
00:09:53,825 --> 00:09:55,464
And she was driving drunk too.

126
00:09:56,358 --> 00:09:58,474
You should get your own facts straight,
Ambassador.

127
00:10:12,218 --> 00:10:14,303
Your limp seems to be getting better.

128
00:10:14,537 --> 00:10:15,537
Yeah.

129
00:10:16,272 --> 00:10:18,823
Ji Hu's taking a really long time
to recover.

130
00:10:20,617 --> 00:10:22,405
Jung A.

131
00:10:22,429 --> 00:10:25,778
Didn't you say your cousin
works at a law firm?

132
00:10:25,971 --> 00:10:27,544
Do you happen to know an attorney?

133
00:10:27,568 --> 00:10:28,779
Are you pressing charges
against Do Do Hee?

134
00:10:29,141 --> 00:10:31,810
- Yes.
- I'll check with my cousin.

135
00:10:32,352 --> 00:10:33,976
I'll give a witness statement too.

136
00:10:34,001 --> 00:10:36,119
I saw you right after the accident.

137
00:10:36,300 --> 00:10:37,443
That's right.

138
00:10:38,640 --> 00:10:39,667
Thank you.

139
00:10:39,692 --> 00:10:41,946
Tae O probably knows some lawyers too.

140
00:10:41,996 --> 00:10:43,490
He's not answering my calls.

141
00:10:43,938 --> 00:10:45,512
After his grandfather's funeral,

142
00:10:45,536 --> 00:10:47,676
he must be busy supporting his parents.

143
00:10:47,678 --> 00:10:48,968
Still...

144
00:10:49,054 --> 00:10:51,816
I can't reach him. It's strange.

145
00:10:55,091 --> 00:10:57,325
You know I have feelings for you.

146
00:10:57,937 --> 00:10:58,970
Are you uncomfortable?

147
00:10:59,187 --> 00:11:01,052
The thought of love makes my skin crawl.

148
00:11:01,054 --> 00:11:02,103
How many times must I say it?

149
00:11:02,153 --> 00:11:03,857
Why do you keep pushing me to this point?

150
00:11:07,019 --> 00:11:08,977
I think I've been so arrogant.

151
00:11:09,214 --> 00:11:10,787
I deserve to be punished.

152
00:11:10,811 --> 00:11:12,222
Why all of a sudden?

153
00:11:12,538 --> 00:11:14,286
Tell me what you mean.

154
00:11:14,311 --> 00:11:16,003
You always say things only you understand.

155
00:11:18,950 --> 00:11:22,623
- Mom.
- When did you come out here?

156
00:11:22,798 --> 00:11:24,648
Jung A, look at her face.

157
00:11:24,677 --> 00:11:26,767
She hasn't been sleeping or eating.

158
00:11:26,792 --> 00:11:29,544
- It's driving me crazy.
- I'm fine.

159
00:11:30,539 --> 00:11:33,142
- Ji Hu hasn't even woken...
- That damn Ji Hu!

160
00:11:33,167 --> 00:11:36,609
He's not my child. You're my daughter.

161
00:11:36,732 --> 00:11:38,619
Go to the hospital for an IV today,

162
00:11:38,643 --> 00:11:41,276
or get herbal medicine at a clinic.
Do one or the other.

163
00:11:41,498 --> 00:11:44,513
Do you know
how badly a car accident can hurt you?

164
00:11:44,538 --> 00:11:46,792
Ji Hu's the one who was hit by a car.

165
00:11:46,817 --> 00:11:48,988
I was about to be hit,

166
00:11:49,012 --> 00:11:52,124
but Ji Hu saved me.
I only tumbled onto the road.

167
00:11:53,315 --> 00:11:54,778
Your nose is bleeding!

168
00:11:54,789 --> 00:11:57,710
Jung A, get some tissues!

169
00:11:57,762 --> 00:11:59,684
- Seriously!
- Here.

170
00:12:01,786 --> 00:12:03,311
You always overreact.

171
00:12:03,549 --> 00:12:05,064
You little brat.

172
00:12:05,232 --> 00:12:07,622
Wait until you have a child, you brat!

173
00:12:12,008 --> 00:12:13,274
I'm okay.

174
00:13:10,951 --> 00:13:12,094
Ji Ni.

175
00:13:12,698 --> 00:13:14,362
If you've opened this letter,

176
00:13:15,115 --> 00:13:18,520
I suppose you didn't reject my gift.

177
00:13:20,625 --> 00:13:21,625
I...

178
00:13:22,081 --> 00:13:24,184
saw myself in you.

179
00:13:25,091 --> 00:13:26,904
I thought we were so much alike.

180
00:13:28,590 --> 00:13:30,021
Having someone just like you...

181
00:13:30,845 --> 00:13:32,572
can be a kind of salvation.

182
00:13:33,365 --> 00:13:35,142
While trying so hard to be loved,

183
00:13:35,901 --> 00:13:37,498
I kept wishing I were dead.

184
00:13:37,795 --> 00:13:41,853
Loving you was the first thing
that made me feel truly alive.

185
00:13:43,073 --> 00:13:44,192
Strange, isn't it?

186
00:13:44,675 --> 00:13:47,955
Giving love has brought me peace.

187
00:13:49,332 --> 00:13:51,511
I'm at peace even with your rejection.

188
00:13:52,700 --> 00:13:53,998
Happy birthday.

189
00:13:54,690 --> 00:13:58,558
Don't ever think you were born
without anyone's blessing.

190
00:13:59,791 --> 00:14:02,003
I wish you every blessing
with all my heart.

191
00:14:04,193 --> 00:14:05,333
I love you.

192
00:14:06,904 --> 00:14:08,941
More than I want to live another day.

193
00:14:11,452 --> 00:14:12,736
Happy birthday.

194
00:14:32,788 --> 00:14:34,201
Thank you, Sa Bin.

195
00:14:34,341 --> 00:14:36,621
Ji Ni, let's have a meal with Sa Bin.

196
00:14:37,598 --> 00:14:39,731
Ji Ni, why are you crying?

197
00:14:40,799 --> 00:14:42,130
Sir.

198
00:14:42,793 --> 00:14:46,492
Could you help me see Ji Hu?

199
00:14:46,860 --> 00:14:48,255
Just once.

200
00:14:48,971 --> 00:14:51,201
I feel like I'm losing my mind.

201
00:14:52,632 --> 00:14:54,856
I just want to see his face.

202
00:14:56,796 --> 00:14:58,543
Sir...

203
00:15:08,498 --> 00:15:10,235
He still hasn't woken up, right?

204
00:15:10,674 --> 00:15:11,821
This is awful.

205
00:15:12,252 --> 00:15:14,565
I hear the longer it takes,
the greater the risk of lasting effects.

206
00:15:14,567 --> 00:15:15,661
Why are you so worried?

207
00:15:15,811 --> 00:15:18,020
- Were you that close to Ji Hu?
- What do you mean, why?

208
00:15:18,022 --> 00:15:19,702
You can see how much Ji Ni's hurting.

209
00:15:19,805 --> 00:15:22,818
He ended up like this saving her.
If he still hasn't woken up...

210
00:15:25,232 --> 00:15:26,387
By the way,

211
00:15:26,987 --> 00:15:30,742
if he jumped in front of a car for her,
he must love her, right?

212
00:15:31,345 --> 00:15:32,815
Is there really nothing between them?

213
00:15:32,917 --> 00:15:34,225
That's what I wondered.

214
00:15:34,452 --> 00:15:36,280
She said they weren't dating.

215
00:15:36,505 --> 00:15:39,512
If there's something between them,
Do Do Hee might feel unfairly blamed.

216
00:15:39,768 --> 00:15:40,925
She got so much hate for it.

217
00:15:40,932 --> 00:15:42,585
What are you saying?

218
00:15:42,792 --> 00:15:44,268
That doesn't excuse what she did.

219
00:15:44,352 --> 00:15:45,724
That's true, but...

220
00:15:46,392 --> 00:15:48,080
she was really struggling too.

221
00:15:48,385 --> 00:15:49,948
You're talking nonsense again.

222
00:15:50,332 --> 00:15:51,985
Don't defend someone like her.

223
00:15:52,071 --> 00:15:53,511
Did you get attached to her on set?

224
00:15:54,198 --> 00:15:56,021
That's not what happened,

225
00:15:56,435 --> 00:15:57,945
but she has reason to feel wronged.

226
00:15:58,292 --> 00:15:59,925
The man she was engaged to...

227
00:15:59,927 --> 00:16:02,369
risked his life to save another woman.

228
00:16:02,398 --> 00:16:06,158
Are you a bad judge of women,
or just a bad judge of people?

229
00:16:06,185 --> 00:16:07,937
You still haven't learned your lesson?

230
00:16:08,425 --> 00:16:10,223
She tried to kill someone.

231
00:16:10,225 --> 00:16:11,710
There's no excuse for that.

232
00:16:11,712 --> 00:16:13,066
I'm not saying there is.

233
00:16:15,885 --> 00:16:17,623
Why pick on me while we're eating?

234
00:16:17,625 --> 00:16:19,492
You can't mind your own business.

235
00:16:19,911 --> 00:16:21,501
Worry about yourself.

236
00:16:22,105 --> 00:16:23,864
I can take care of myself.

237
00:16:25,124 --> 00:16:26,249
Sit down.

238
00:16:27,605 --> 00:16:29,437
Has doing things your way ever worked?

239
00:16:29,618 --> 00:16:31,525
You always come back hurt or heartbroken.

240
00:16:31,698 --> 00:16:32,862
Are you still a child?

241
00:16:33,338 --> 00:16:35,410
How long must mom and I worry about you?

242
00:16:35,412 --> 00:16:37,389
Then stop worrying!

243
00:16:38,351 --> 00:16:39,351
Fine.

244
00:16:39,459 --> 00:16:41,077
I've done plenty of stupid things.

245
00:16:41,471 --> 00:16:44,248
But must you bring them up every time?

246
00:16:44,853 --> 00:16:46,093
Worry about yourself.

247
00:16:46,424 --> 00:16:49,356
You quit your job and wander around.
Will that bring your wife back?

248
00:16:49,932 --> 00:16:51,412
Get a grip yourself.

249
00:16:51,516 --> 00:16:53,011
You punk. I've gone easy on you...

250
00:16:53,141 --> 00:16:55,039
If you're so worked up, see a doctor.

251
00:16:55,505 --> 00:16:57,250
Stop picking fights with me.

252
00:17:00,358 --> 00:17:01,417
That little...

253
00:17:13,781 --> 00:17:15,708
(No Visitors Allowed)

254
00:17:19,879 --> 00:17:21,704
(Visiting Is Allowed)

255
00:17:21,726 --> 00:17:23,104
(Studies in Criminal Case Law)

256
00:17:26,145 --> 00:17:27,938
Why is this so hard to understand?

257
00:17:32,018 --> 00:17:33,095
Director?

258
00:17:48,791 --> 00:17:50,691
What are you doing?

259
00:17:55,678 --> 00:17:57,475
So you lied about being sick too?

260
00:18:01,038 --> 00:18:02,217
Why did you come?

261
00:18:03,101 --> 00:18:05,138
- To see if I was lying?
- Why are you living this way?

262
00:18:05,139 --> 00:18:07,849
I'm fighting to the very end
so I don't have to live like this.

263
00:18:07,851 --> 00:18:10,238
Was Im Ji Hu your last hope?

264
00:18:10,240 --> 00:18:12,926
Someone like Ji Hu,
who sees me for who I am?

265
00:18:13,369 --> 00:18:14,625
I'd never met anyone like him.

266
00:18:14,694 --> 00:18:18,215
But Na Ji Ni got involved again.

267
00:18:18,605 --> 00:18:21,228
She exposed that I can't draw...

268
00:18:21,840 --> 00:18:25,174
and that my mom hits me.
How could I not snap?

269
00:18:26,085 --> 00:18:27,888
Ji Ni didn't do that.

270
00:18:28,792 --> 00:18:30,733
You brought it all to light yourself.

271
00:18:32,379 --> 00:18:33,379
I know.

272
00:18:33,544 --> 00:18:34,544
You do?

273
00:18:34,611 --> 00:18:36,045
I need an excuse.

274
00:18:36,725 --> 00:18:38,267
Na Ji Ni's an easy target.

275
00:18:39,612 --> 00:18:41,813
She's terrified of being known
as the daughter of a mistress...

276
00:18:41,973 --> 00:18:43,383
and of having to face people.

277
00:18:43,699 --> 00:18:45,167
That's what scares her most.

278
00:18:48,492 --> 00:18:50,632
Then why did you come?

279
00:18:50,835 --> 00:18:52,031
I was curious.

280
00:18:52,972 --> 00:18:54,522
But now I get it.

281
00:18:55,145 --> 00:18:56,824
You're beyond help.

282
00:18:57,000 --> 00:18:58,038
You're at rock bottom.

283
00:18:58,052 --> 00:19:00,475
Why the hell are you acting like this
when we're in the same boat?

284
00:19:01,411 --> 00:19:04,152
You're an idiot, and so am I.

285
00:19:05,752 --> 00:19:08,307
Isn't that why we connected?

286
00:19:12,092 --> 00:19:15,303
You thought we were in this together,
so you told me everything so easily?

287
00:19:16,080 --> 00:19:17,159
Not at all.

288
00:19:17,571 --> 00:19:19,684
I loved someone so much I thought I'd die.

289
00:19:20,738 --> 00:19:23,496
But when I realized it wasn't right,
I ended it.

290
00:19:23,497 --> 00:19:24,703
You're lying.

291
00:19:25,392 --> 00:19:26,507
How is that even possible?

292
00:19:26,788 --> 00:19:27,788
Try it sometime.

293
00:19:34,652 --> 00:19:37,018
Give me some sleeping pills!

294
00:19:37,690 --> 00:19:39,245
I just need to get some sleep.

295
00:19:51,207 --> 00:19:52,979
I told you not to look at that.

296
00:19:53,116 --> 00:19:54,933
I need to see it too.

297
00:20:05,017 --> 00:20:07,280
Who on earth is Na Ji Ni?

298
00:20:08,298 --> 00:20:10,486
What is she to him that he'd go this far?

299
00:20:14,365 --> 00:20:15,554
Even Do Hee...

300
00:20:16,497 --> 00:20:19,314
was fine until Ji Ni showed up.

301
00:20:19,898 --> 00:20:21,349
This is all her fault.

302
00:20:21,351 --> 00:20:22,947
Let's not think about anything else.

303
00:20:23,577 --> 00:20:25,768
Let's just hope Ji Hu wakes up.

304
00:20:45,358 --> 00:20:46,631
Yes, Sa Bin.

305
00:20:48,009 --> 00:20:49,446
Ji Ni's coming?

306
00:20:50,898 --> 00:20:53,301
Sun Kyung and Joong Bin are here.

307
00:20:53,434 --> 00:20:57,010
Once they leave,
I'll find a chance to call you.

308
00:20:57,072 --> 00:20:58,981
Tell her to wait nearby.

309
00:20:59,307 --> 00:21:00,307
Okay.

310
00:21:58,005 --> 00:21:59,157
Ma'am.

311
00:22:00,277 --> 00:22:01,507
Why...

312
00:22:02,338 --> 00:22:03,474
won't Ji Hu...

313
00:22:04,232 --> 00:22:06,468
wake up?

314
00:22:07,559 --> 00:22:09,960
He's healing,
both physically and emotionally.

315
00:22:10,429 --> 00:22:13,502
Have faith. He loves you.

316
00:22:21,045 --> 00:22:22,271
Ji Hu,

317
00:22:24,147 --> 00:22:26,030
please wake up.

318
00:22:27,457 --> 00:22:29,355
I'm sorry for what I did.

319
00:22:32,845 --> 00:22:34,018
I...

320
00:22:36,654 --> 00:22:38,723
like you too.

321
00:22:43,732 --> 00:22:45,804
How could I not like you?

322
00:22:47,425 --> 00:22:49,956
You look at me with so much love.

323
00:22:51,965 --> 00:22:54,808
You've saved me so many times.

324
00:22:58,005 --> 00:22:59,005
I...

325
00:23:02,220 --> 00:23:06,788
just thought I wasn't allowed
to love anyone.

326
00:23:10,591 --> 00:23:11,591
Because...

327
00:23:12,779 --> 00:23:14,679
I'm a sinner.

328
00:23:26,052 --> 00:23:27,969
I won't lie anymore.

329
00:23:30,425 --> 00:23:32,219
When you wake up,

330
00:23:33,564 --> 00:23:36,088
I'll love you honestly.

331
00:23:37,511 --> 00:23:39,728
I'll show you how much I care.

332
00:23:41,905 --> 00:23:44,102
So please wake up.

333
00:23:45,240 --> 00:23:46,240
Please.

334
00:23:50,298 --> 00:23:51,980
Ji Hu knows too.

335
00:23:52,705 --> 00:23:54,901
He understands everything. Don't worry.

336
00:23:57,751 --> 00:23:59,089
Ma'am,

337
00:23:59,925 --> 00:24:02,128
I'm in love with Ji Hu.

338
00:24:03,225 --> 00:24:05,805
I know I shouldn't be.

339
00:24:07,412 --> 00:24:08,537
But now,

340
00:24:09,194 --> 00:24:11,321
I really can't take it anymore.

341
00:24:14,898 --> 00:24:16,910
I should've been the one who got hurt.

342
00:24:16,912 --> 00:24:18,412
Don't say that.

343
00:24:19,118 --> 00:24:21,156
He wanted to save you.

344
00:24:21,158 --> 00:24:22,600
Because he loves you.

345
00:24:23,965 --> 00:24:26,639
Now do what you can for him.

346
00:24:27,405 --> 00:24:29,666
And don't run away anymore.

347
00:24:32,672 --> 00:24:33,785
Okay.

348
00:24:52,838 --> 00:24:54,079
What brings you here?

349
00:24:54,081 --> 00:24:56,881
I was curious about Ji Hu.

350
00:24:56,883 --> 00:24:58,005
Curious?

351
00:24:59,872 --> 00:25:01,313
I appreciate your concern,

352
00:25:01,912 --> 00:25:03,756
but I'd rather you didn't come here.

353
00:25:13,332 --> 00:25:14,511
You...

354
00:25:16,269 --> 00:25:18,124
What are you doing here?

355
00:25:19,007 --> 00:25:20,221
Sun Kyung.

356
00:25:21,877 --> 00:25:23,044
Sun Kyung!

357
00:25:23,085 --> 00:25:25,554
Didn't I tell you to stay away?

358
00:25:26,545 --> 00:25:28,041
I'm sorry.

359
00:25:29,012 --> 00:25:32,421
- But...
- So you just ignore what I tell you?

360
00:25:32,885 --> 00:25:34,683
You have no pedigree.

361
00:25:34,938 --> 00:25:37,997
You put my son in the hospital,
and now you come here to cry?

362
00:25:39,019 --> 00:25:41,118
Stop! Don't do this!

363
00:25:41,286 --> 00:25:43,322
You're the problem, Yeong Ju.

364
00:25:43,458 --> 00:25:45,271
Who are you to keep bringing her here?

365
00:25:45,272 --> 00:25:46,386
Who do you think you are?

366
00:25:46,471 --> 00:25:48,251
I'm sorry. This is my fault.

367
00:25:48,288 --> 00:25:49,640
I asked her to come.

368
00:25:49,652 --> 00:25:51,596
Yeong Ju, you're way out of line.

369
00:25:51,732 --> 00:25:54,883
You think marrying into the family
makes you one of us?

370
00:25:55,665 --> 00:25:58,281
How dare you bring this girl
to my son's side...

371
00:25:58,363 --> 00:25:59,665
without my permission?

372
00:25:59,666 --> 00:26:02,512
- How can you say something so cruel?
- Get out!

373
00:26:02,751 --> 00:26:04,371
I can't stand the sight of you!

374
00:26:05,721 --> 00:26:06,721
Go!

375
00:26:10,318 --> 00:26:11,575
That's enough!

376
00:26:11,837 --> 00:26:14,186
You're all in this together, right?

377
00:26:15,132 --> 00:26:16,358
Don't you dare hit him!

378
00:26:16,585 --> 00:26:17,960
Take Ji Ni and leave.

379
00:26:19,253 --> 00:26:20,464
Mom, you come with me too.

380
00:26:21,313 --> 00:26:22,619
Fine, get out.

381
00:26:22,818 --> 00:26:24,403
All of you, get out!

382
00:26:24,405 --> 00:26:26,862
You filthy beggars, sullying our family!

383
00:26:27,325 --> 00:26:29,421
All of you, get out!

384
00:26:29,796 --> 00:26:31,558
Get out!

385
00:28:30,438 --> 00:28:33,891
(Family Register)

386
00:28:33,892 --> 00:28:35,499
Ji Ni is your daughter?

387
00:28:35,500 --> 00:28:36,890
Don't you think
you're being too hard on her?

388
00:28:36,892 --> 00:28:38,710
He got into an accident because of Ji Ni.

389
00:28:38,712 --> 00:28:40,910
You're making sure Do Do Hee
can't get away with this, right?

390
00:28:40,912 --> 00:28:42,423
What if I refuse to drop the charges?

391
00:28:42,425 --> 00:28:44,941
I'll dig into the things you covered up.

392
00:28:44,943 --> 00:28:46,045
Ji Ni's missing.

393
00:28:46,046 --> 00:28:47,343
- Something's not right.
- Na Ji Ni?

394
00:28:47,345 --> 00:28:50,310
- She's my younger sister.
- Are you all Cha Min Ki's children?

395
00:28:50,312 --> 00:28:51,665
Just die already!

396
00:28:51,666 --> 00:28:53,366
I'm sorry, Ji Hu.

397
00:28:53,813 --> 00:28:55,813
(Subtitles are provided by KOCOWA.)
